# Local design history; retain the implementation record and UI evidence only.
ui/design/*
!ui/design/hybrid-aero-20260928/
ui/design/hybrid-aero-20260928/*
!ui/design/hybrid-aero-20260928/IMPLEMENTATION.md
!ui/design/hybrid-aero-20260928/hybrid-ui-result.png

# Modeling source inputs are versioned; generated CAD and solver runs stay local.
